OCR Word Search Solver
=====================

Directory Structure:
-------------------
src/
  img/       - Image preprocessing tools (grayscale, contrast adjustment, rotation)
  ocr/       - Neural network implementation for letter recognition
  solver/    - Word search solver
  segment/   - Tools for analyzing image layout, detecting cells, and extracting word lists

Building:
---------
Each subdirectory contains a Makefile. For example, to build the image preprocessing tool:
     cd src/img
     make

Usage:
------
1. Preprocess an image:
   ./preprocess <image_file>
   This generates gray.bmp, contrast.bmp, and rotated.bmp.

2. Train or run the neural network:
   ./neural_net
   The program trains a simple XNOR network and prints test outputs.

3. Solve a word search:
   ./solver <grid_file> <word>
   Outputs the coordinates of the word in the grid or "Not found".

4. Segment an image:
   Run the compiled tools in the segment directory to detect cells and extract word lists.

Cleaning:
---------
To remove compiled binaries and object files, use:

  make clean

Dependencies:
-------------
- GCC compiler
- SDL2 and SDL2_image libraries (for image preprocessing)
- Standard C libraries (math.h, stdlib.h, etc.)
